<view class="page" wx:if="{{ready}}"><view class="eyebrow">OUR TABLE / FINISH</view><view class="title">这顿饭，做了什么</view><view class="subtitle">{{title}} · {{date}}</view><view class="notice">删掉没做的菜，补上实际做的菜。确认后会保留点单记录，实际菜品用于统计与评价。</view><view class="notice" wx:if="{{loading}}">正在获取最新点单…</view><view class="error" wx:if="{{error}}">{{error}}<text class="link" wx:if="{{retryPending}}" bindtap="retry">核对结果并重试</text></view><view class="notice" wx:if="{{notice}}">{{notice}}</view>
<view class="section"><view class="row"><text class="subtitle">实际做过的菜</text><text class="link" bindtap="reset">重新载入点单</text></view><view class="item" wx:for="{{rows}}" wx:key="localId"><view class="row"><text>{{item.name}}</text><text class="link" data-id="{{item.localId}}" bindtap="remove">移除</text></view><view class="muted">{{item.specText}} · {{item.input.sourceOrderItemId ? '原点单' : '补做的菜'}}</view><view class="row quantity"><button class="small" data-id="{{item.localId}}" data-delta="-1" bindtap="quantity" disabled="{{busy || retryPending || item.input.quantity <= 1}}">−</button><text>{{item.input.quantity}} 份</text><button class="small" data-id="{{item.localId}}" data-delta="1" bindtap="quantity" disabled="{{busy || retryPending || item.input.quantity >= 99}}">＋</button></view></view><view class="muted" wx:if="{{!rows.length}}">没有实际菜品，可以从本店菜单补选，或标记这顿没做。</view></view>
<view class="section" wx:if="{{candidates.length}}"><view class="subtitle">从本店菜单补选</view><view class="muted">包含下架和非当季菜，不能新建菜单外的菜。</view><picker range="{{candidates}}" range-key="name" value="{{candidateIndex}}" bindchange="candidate" disabled="{{busy || retryPending}}"><view class="picker">{{candidates[candidateIndex].name}} ▾</view></picker><picker wx:for="{{choices}}" wx:key="name" range="{{item.options}}" range-key="name" value="{{item.index}}" data-index="{{index}}" bindchange="option" disabled="{{busy || retryPending}}"><view class="picker">{{item.name}}：{{item.options[item.index].name}} ▾</view></picker><button class="secondary" bindtap="add" disabled="{{busy || retryPending}}">添加这道菜</button></view>
<button wx:if="{{!loading && !available}}" class="secondary" bindtap="back">返回餐单详情</button>
<button class="primary" bindtap="save" loading="{{busy}}" disabled="{{!available || loading || busy || retryPending}}">确认完成这顿饭</button><button class="secondary" bindtap="notCooked" disabled="{{!available || loading || busy || retryPending}}">这顿没做</button></view>
